Your cunning manipulations allow you to use charms (wands, totems and torques) more efficiently, reducing their cooldowns and the power cost of all usable items by [15%, 24%, 30%, 35%, 39% (TL1-5)].

In addition your knowledge of devices allows you to disarm known traps ([44, 61, 73, 82, 90 (TL1-5; CUN 100)] disarm 'power', improves with Cunning).
